# Book 8 completion pass, Step 3 — LANE B REPORT (chapters 31–60)

Same-author texture pass by the O'Connor 1.3 seat (Monroe 1.3 voice). Every word of chapters 31–60 was read in order and edited in place with the Edit tool, one sentence at a time. No script, sed or bulk replacement touched a manuscript file. Nothing under `books/` or `v3-runs/` was opened; no `plan-audit*`, `source-tracking*`, `review-*` or `recheck-*` file was read; `whole-arc-read.md` §11 was not read. No git command was run. Chapters 1–30 were not edited. Nothing was written in the repository root; helper files are in `state/completion/laneB/` only, and the scratch copies used for one bisect were deleted.

