- **#53 (needed before Book 8 Movement 4).** Protected "it took four years and a hearing to walk out". The plan itself notes the figure does not fit the academy span; #18 bars numbers for time since Kindling, and Book 7's first pole was amended on that ground. **Default:** verbatim, as Cael's rough spoken figure, never repeated as fact. Options: (1) the default; (2) release only "four years" for wording without a number, as was done for Book 7's first pole; (3) settle the series calendar so that it is true.
