   368	
   369	"Every other one, yours worked and ours died," she said.
   370	
   371	"Yes."
   372	
   373	"You think this one's different."
   374	
   375	"I think this one's the first one they made," he said. "I think if any place on the continent is going to tell me what I am, it's the one they built to make sure I'd never be."
   376	
   377	He stepped over the line.
   378	
   379	His Path did not die. It also did not *notice* it should have.
