editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/movement-008/plan-audit-apply.md-45-   old: `[[TIER-B: "A third time on that arm and I'll set it in a splint. That's not a healer's opinion. That's a fact about a line." / "Noted," / "Everybody says that now," — three lines; BOOK_MAP §13 gives the third to Oryn ("Oryn's 'Everybody says that now' comes on the 304th"); the first two are not pinned. Staged on the shelf, an hour after the fall: Oryn on the upper baulk, grey from the shin, speaking to the arm from her distance without touching it (she has not been asked to read it, and the older healer has it on her board); Teague standing; so Oryn / Teague / Oryn. If the first line is the older healer's, it cannot be said in the six's hearing in this movement — coordinator to supply protected text]]`
