+    - Before: `She did not say anything for a while. She was looking where he was looking, which was nowhere, since there was nothing out there to look at; and he could hear, behind the two of them, a big man and a small pale woman and a quiet one, and a stick, who had all come to stand at that rim without being asked.`
+    - After: `*One.*`
